INPUT PROGRAM.
LOOP #i=0 TO 15.
 COMPUTE b0=MOD(#i,2).
 COMPUTE b1=MOD(TRUNC(#i/2),2).
 COMPUTE b2=MOD(TRUNC(#i/4),2).
 COMPUTE b3=MOD(TRUNC(#i/8),2).
 COMPUTE mean4=b0+b1+b2+b3.
 COMPUTE p2=(mean4=2).
 COMPUTE se2=2/SQRT(2).
 COMPUTE se4=2/SQRT(4).
 END CASE.
END LOOP.
END FILE.
END INPUT PROGRAM.
FORMATS mean4 p2 se2 se4 (F8.4).
FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=mean4.
DESCRIPTIVES VARIABLES=p2 se2 se4 /STATISTICS=MEAN SUM.
